+    r"""Load a chromatogram.
+
+    Arguments
+    ---------
+    path
+        ``.ab1`` / ``.abi`` file.
+    engine
+        ``'auto'`` (tracy when installed, else Biopython), ``'tracy'``, or
+        ``'biopython'``. Only tracy reports the **secondary** basecall, so
+        :attr:`SangerTrace.mixed_positions` is empty under Biopython.
